    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">Learn why a Child Development Associate (CDA) credential ensures your provider understands modern childhood psychology, health standards, and individualized curriculum.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">What Is the CDA Credential?</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">The Child Development Associate (CDA) Credential is the most widely recognized credential in early childhood education (ECE) in the United States, administered by the Council for Professional Recognition. It requires 120 hours of training across 8 core competency areas and 480 hours of verified working experience.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">A CDA Certified provider has been evaluated by an independent Council specialist during an unannounced live classroom observation.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">The 6 Core Competency Goals</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Earning a CDA requires demonstrating mastery in establishing safe, healthy learning environments, advancing physical and intellectual competence, and fostering social-emotional maturity.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Safe, sanitized physical and emotional learning environments.</li>\n  <li>Age-tailored literacy, numbers, and sensory activities.</li>\n  <li>Positive guidance, emotional labeling, and parent collaboration.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">What This Means for Your Child</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Because our provider is CDA Certified, your child is intellectually engaged through intentional, developmentally appropriate teaching rather than merely babysat.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
