    "author": "CDA Certified Provider • Sunny Skies",
    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">Serving service members near Fort Belvoir and Marine Corps Base Quantico: How the MCCYN subsidy program helps reduce your out-of-pocket childcare tuition.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">What Is the MCCYN Fee Assistance Program?</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Military Child Care in Your Neighborhood (MCCYN) is a Department of Defense (DoD) fee assistance program that bridges the cost difference between on-base CDC tuition rates and high-quality off-base civilian childcare providers for military families.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Sunny Skies Daycare is ideally located in Lorton, VA, just minutes from the Tulley Gate and Pence Gate at Fort Belvoir, offering 6:00 AM – 6:00 PM operating hours.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Who Is Eligible in Northern Virginia?</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Eligible service members include Army, Navy, Air Force, Marine Corps, Space Force, and Coast Guard families stationed at Fort Belvoir, MCB Quantico, the Pentagon, and Coast Guard Headquarters.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Active duty military service members.</li>\n  <li>National Guard and Reserve on active federal orders.</li>\n  <li>DoD civilian employees when authorized by their branch.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">How Sunny Skies Daycare Supports Military Families</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">We happily supply all required state licensing proof, CDA certifications, and monthly attendance sheets to make your subsidy application smooth and fast.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
