    "author": "CDA Certified Provider • Sunny Skies",
    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">How creative food presentation, banana coins, sliced apples, and colorful veggie plates encourage even picky eaters to develop lifelong healthy habits.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Visual Presentation: Fruit Art for Picky Eaters</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Children eat with their eyes first! At Sunny Skies Daycare, we slice bananas into cheerful coins, arrange apple crescents into smiling faces, and present sweet berries alongside whole wheat crackers to invite curious tasting.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Never force a toddler to eat. Presenting colorful choices in a family-style platter encourages natural self-regulation and positive food associations.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Our Top 4 Finger Foods for Toddlers</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Finger foods should be soft enough to mash between gums, cut into safe bite-sized shapes, and nutrient-dense to fuel active play.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Steamed Sweet Potato Bites: Rich in Vitamin A and easy to chew.</li>\n  <li>Banana & Oat Drops: Soft, homemade two-ingredient snacks packed with fiber.</li>\n  <li>Cubed Mild Cheddar & Sliced Apples: The ultimate protein and crunch combo.</li>\n  <li>Steamed Broccoli Trees: Dipped in mild hummus or Greek yogurt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">USDA CACFP Standards in Action</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">All fresh fruit plates, whole milk, and warm lunches are prepared fresh daily under the USDA CACFP program at zero charge to enrolled families.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
