    "metaDescription": "Discover why morning circle time accelerates speech, social bonding, and kindergarten readiness. Daily weather charts and songs at Sunny Skies Daycare.",
    "excerpt": "Every morning at 8:45 AM, our children gather on the interactive rug for calendar reading, weather forecasting, and rhyming. Here is why this ritual is so powerful.",
