    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">Children need fresh air, green grass, and sunshine. Learn about our fenced play yard in Lorton and the cognitive benefits of daily outdoor discovery.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">The Necessity of Daily Outdoor Play</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Human children need to run, climb, breathe fresh air, and soak up natural sunlight. Research confirms that daily outdoor play boosts immune resilience, improves vision, and strengthens gross motor balance.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Weather permitting, children at Sunny Skies spend 60 to 90 minutes outdoors every day in our secure, private fenced yard in Lorton, VA.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Gross Motor Games in Our Fenced Yard</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Our private yard features low basketball hoops, soft grassy areas for running, toss games, and balloon sensory exercises that build cardiovascular endurance and hand-eye coordination.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Basketball tossing and catching games building shoulder strength.</li>\n  <li>Gross motor balance courses across soft green grass.</li>\n  <li>Safe, gated perimeter preventing any street access.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Neighborhood Nature Walks</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">We also take supervised nature walks through our quiet Lorton neighborhood, collecting autumn leaves, observing birds, and discussing seasonal weather shifts.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
