    "author": "CDA Certified Provider • Sunny Skies",
    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">How manipulating geometric shapes and fitting puzzle pieces together builds the spatial logic essential for future mathematics and engineering concepts.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">What Tangrams Teach Young Minds</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Before children can comprehend abstract math symbols, their brains must grasp spatial geometry in physical three dimensions. Wooden tangram puzzles and shape sorters are among the most powerful early STEM tools available.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Manipulating physical wooden shapes wires spatial rotation, patience, and fingertip tactile sensitivity far more deeply than flat screen apps.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Decomposition of Geometric Shapes</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Children discover that two small triangles fit together to make a square, and two squares make a rectangle. This visual intuition forms the foundation for elementary geometry.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Montessori-inspired wooden shape clock puzzles.</li>\n  <li>Colorful tangram animal pattern cards.</li>\n  <li>Tactile 1-to-100 number counting grids.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Trial-and-Error & Resilience</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Puzzles teach children that making mistakes is not failure; it is simply a clue to rotate the piece and try another angle with patience.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
