    "author": "CDA Certified Provider • Sunny Skies",
    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">A look inside our dedicated infant nursery and the non-negotiable safe sleep protocols we follow to protect newborns and infants.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">The ABCs of Safe Infant Sleep</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">For parents leaving an infant in someone else's care, sleep safety is a primary concern. At Sunny Skies Daycare, our infant sleep protocols strictly adhere to the American Academy of Pediatrics (AAP) guidelines.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Every infant sleeps ALONE, on their BACK, in a dedicated, safety-certified CRIB with a firm mattress and tight-fitting sheet. Zero loose blankets or pillows.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Direct Line-of-Sight Supervision & Logs</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Our infant nursery is within direct sight and sound of our caregiver. We perform visual checks every 15 minutes, noting breathing, body temperature, and sleep position in our infant logs.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Separate, uncrowded cribs with firm mattresses.</li>\n  <li>Breathable sleep sacks used in place of loose blankets.</li>\n  <li>Sanitized crib linens laundered regularly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Peaceful Sleep Sanctuary</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Gentle white noise, soft ambient lighting, and strict hygiene ensure babies sleep peacefully according to their own biological rhythm.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
