    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">Make the most of your in-person visit. From teacher credentials to sanitation schedules, here are the essential questions to bring to your tour.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Trust Your Senses on the Walkthrough</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">A website provides information, but an in-person tour lets you assess the room's energy, hygiene, provider warmth, and children's engagement with your own eyes.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Always visit during active hours so you can observe how the provider interacts with children, handles questions, and manages transitions.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Top Questions to Bring to Your Visit</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Ask about state licensing, CDA credentials, infant sleep procedures, USDA CACFP meals, and daily sanitization protocols.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Verify Virginia Department of Education licensing and background checks.</li>\n  <li>Inspect crib safety, toy hygiene, and fenced yard security.</li>\n  <li>Review the daily 6:00 AM – 6:00 PM routine and parent communication.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Schedule Your Tour at Sunny Skies</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">We love meeting families and answering questions openly. Book an appointment online or call us directly to select a convenient date.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
